---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
import Img from '../components/Img.astro';
import YouTube from '../components/YouTube.astro';
---

<Base
  title="LBP3 - Level - Troubling Motive | Linus Ekberg"
  description="Troubling Motive, a LittleBigPlanet 3 community level that was awarded a Team Pick."
>
  <div class="project wrap">
    <Card class="solo">
      <h1 class="page-title">UGC Level - LittleBigPlanet 3 - Troubling Motive</h1>
      <div class="solo-top">
        <div>
          <ul class="facts">
            <li>Solo project</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="solo-text">
            <p>In this level I wanted two main mechanics. The Paintinator which lets you shoot paintballs, and breakable boxes.</p>
            <p>
              The team behind LittleBigPlanet 3 awarded this level with a <em>Team Pick</em>, which is a stamp of approval, and
              shows up in the game as levels they recommend.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <YouTube id="siejGwOMUxU" title="LittleBigPlanet 3 - Troubling Motive" class="video" />
      </div>
      <h2 class="subtitle reviews-title">Reviews</h2>
      <div class="review-cols">
        <div class="reviews">
          <Img
            name="image-14.png"
            width={472}
            alt="Review: Pretty short, but wonderfully crafted! Love that it feels like a level from previous games with the scrolling Canyons background and the 3 layers limit."
          />
          <Img name="image-13.png" width={472} alt="Review: Fun as hell and well crafted. Good work" />
          <Img
            name="image-15.png"
            width={472}
            alt="Review: Really awesome level!! The decoration, gameplay, and story was very well made, and flowed really well! I do have to say that it was pretty short, but it was just due to thermometer limitations. Really fun and well crafted! Hoping this gets Team Picked!"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="reviews offset">
          <Img name="image-16.png" width={465} alt="Review: A really funny platform level with a nice artistic style. Pity it is too short! Anyway, very nice level :)" />
          <Img name="image-17.png" width={465} alt="Review: Adorable!! All the desing is just perfect! Excellent job : D!" />
          <Img name="image-18.png" width={465} alt="Review: Wow... just wow!! This is astonishing!! :)" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </Card>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .solo-top {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 470px) minmax(0, 431px);
  }

  .solo-top .facts {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .solo-top :global(.video) {
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .reviews-title {
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .review-cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 472px) minmax(0, 465px);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .offset {
    padding-top: 40px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .review-cols {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .offset {
      padding-top: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
